==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Graveler|88}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Graveler}}.
*'''Lunge Out''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Makuhita|56}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

